    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: add906302f2e779892f63668e687ce772a9fe46d -->\nMaintainer decision (owner, live answer 2026-11-23): merge this fix for the main that does not build (#3716), after a read of the diff and a trial on current main.\n\nReady to merge. The merging session read the diff: one line in `crates/app/src/commands/operation/recipe.rs`, the arm `OpParams::MultiAxisDeburr { exclude_edges, .. }` joins the `Deburr` arm of `has_saved_geometry`. Nothing else changes.\n\nTrial by a gate-runner that did not write the change: main `5c05d0660` + this head, merge commit `55007b331` on a scratch branch, no conflict.\n\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --tests`: no error, no warning. Main alone does not compile.\n- `camcraft-app --lib`: 303 pass, 0 fail.\n- The test binaries of the two merges that met: `cut_recipe` 20, `mcp_multiaxis_deburr` 9, `mcp_multiaxis_deburr_post` 4, `ribbon` 13, and `project_roundtrip` 80, `mcp_doc_drift` 6, `mcp` 29, `golden_cl` 34: 0 fail.\n- The UI lib tests and clippy still run in that trial; a red result there becomes its own issue.\n- Heavy lanes: not run.\n",
